{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，此命主日主丁火，生于寒冬子月，火气衰弱，需木火调候。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，财星（金）重重，月柱庚子，正财透干，财多身弱之象明显。日支酉金为偏财，配偶宫坐财星，但财多克印（木），早年大运己亥、戊戌为食伤生财，财旺而身弱，感情上虽有异性缘，但难以稳定成婚。\n\n关键在27岁后进入丁酉大运（比肩帮身），但酉金仍为财，身弱财旺，婚姻宫被合（酉丑半合），有婚恋机会，但压力大。37岁后丙申大运，劫财帮身，申金合入婚姻宫（申酉戌三会金局），财星更旺，身弱不胜财，婚姻易有波折。\n\n真正能稳定婚姻的时机，需待大运或流年木火旺来助身。47岁后乙未大运，乙木偏印生身，未土为食神，木火渐旺，身转强，此时财星可任，婚姻方能落实。因此，结婚应在47岁之后，即43—52岁区间（乙未大运前半段）。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4802, "response_id": "4cc2483c-38b0-4ecb-8b6e-6a1526fd0052", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 401, "completion_tokens": 295, "total_tokens": 696, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 17}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水气势强盛，丁火身弱无疑。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，月柱庚子，金水成势，官杀（水）与财星（金）混杂，日支酉金为偏财，形成财生杀攻身的格局。这种组合容易在官非、刑狱方面有隐患，尤其是当大运或流年引动官杀、财星与日主冲战之时。\n\n大运排布中：\n- 7-16岁己亥运，亥水为官杀，但己土食神制水，尚可。\n- 17-26岁戊戌运，戊土伤官合杀，戌土为火库，有一定调候，但伤官见官（水）也易惹是非，不过此运土旺，能泄火生金，官非风险不算最高。\n- 27-36岁丁酉运，丁火比肩帮身，但酉金为财，财生官杀，此运金旺，财滋杀，官非隐患开始显现，但比肩有分力，未必最重。\n- 37-46岁丙申运，丙火劫财帮身，但申金为财，申子半合水局，官杀更旺，财官杀连成一气，此运是官非刑事风险极高的时期，因为劫财抗官杀，容易引发冲突、诉讼、刑事问题。\n- 47-56岁乙未运，乙木偏印生身，未土为食神制杀，此运有化解，风险降低。\n\n问题问“有官非刑事出现的时间”，结合大运，丙申运（37-46岁）是官杀最旺、财生杀攻身最烈的阶段，且丙火劫财与官杀对抗，最易引发刑事官非。选项C为33-42岁，正好覆盖丙申运的大部分（37-42岁），而D为43-53岁，已进入乙未运，风险下降。因此最符合的是C。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6132, "response_id": "6bce605f-a932-461d-a47c-01e994bd70cd", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 407, "completion_tokens": 462, "total_tokens": 869, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 23}, "requested_m