{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字（辛丑、庚子、丁酉、辛丑），日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水极旺，丁火身弱无根，属于从弱格或身弱极需帮扶之局。年、时柱辛丑金湿土晦火，月柱庚子金水一气，日支酉金为偏财，全局财官杀旺而日主孤立。\n\n分析各流年：\n- 1965年乙巳：乙木偏印生丁火，巳火为日主之根，看似有助，但巳酉丑三合金局，反而加重财星耗身，且巳火被合化为金，火根被拔，此年有凶险，但尚非最重。\n- 1968年戊申：戊土伤官泄身，申子辰三合水局（申子半合水），水势更旺，官杀攻身，且申金生水，丁火被克泄交加，此年凶险明显。\n- 1971年辛亥：辛金偏财透干，亥水正官，亥子丑三会水局，水势滔天，丁火被重重官杀围克，且无印比救助，此年灾祸最重。\n- 1974年甲寅：甲木正印生身，寅木为丁火长生之地，且寅午戌无合，但寅木可生火，此年有救应，凶险程度较低。\n\n综合判断，1971年水势最旺，丁火几乎被灭，且无任何生扶，故凶劫之灾最可能在此年。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "6fbdcedb130f902d280faa5ed3bd785b4042c3080e46ea9c87e9c8395734596e", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5163, "response_id": "2f14c794-5d1b-4a88-9487-31ef5b59d50d", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 530, "completion_tokens": 365, "total_tokens": 895, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 512}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 512, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 18}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
